WEBVTT

00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
I am 34 and this is a little bit of my story

00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,000
and how I came to Commerce Clinic.

00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:19,000
So last year, last winter, I was feeling not so great.

00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
I was really uncomfortable in my back.

00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
I went through a lot of ups and downs as far as what could this be

00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
and I just kept ignoring it and going on.

00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
You know, I have three little kids that they're more important.

00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,000
I have to take care of them.

00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,000
And so we just kept living life and I kept having that concern

00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,000
in the back of my mind that something might be wrong.

00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:46,000
And so I started feeling this lump in my midsection more towards my back.

00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
And I was telling my husband about it and he was just, you know,

00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
if you're concerned, just go see a doctor.

00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,000
But the natural mama that I am is like the kind of lady that never goes

00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
to see a medical doctor.

00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:03,000
So I decided, nah, it's probably nothing.

00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Because usually it's probably nothing.

00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,000
And I just kept letting it go and go and go and go.

00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,000
And so finally, I got to the point where I needed to do something about it

00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,000
because I was in a depression.

00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,000
It was always on my mind.

00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000
I was in sleep at night and I finally was like, okay, I'm going to get real.

00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
And I'm going to talk to God and I'm going to ask him what's my move.

00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,000
And so I did.

00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,000
I just, I just prayed it all out to the Lord and I said,

00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:33,000
just wait me to where you need me to go to help get the speaker out.

00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:38,000
And the next day I was talking to a friend of mine who said, hey,

00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:42,000
I used to work at this care practice clinic with this girl that I knew

00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,000
and her dad runs a clinic in the cities.

00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:49,000
And it sounds like it's more of an alternative cancer care clinic.

00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,000
And I was like, okay, that's what you're really worried about.

00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,000
So it's like interesting because I kind of just prayed for a direction

00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:58,000
and somebody just gave me some.

00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:02,000
And so then I made this phone call and the person on the other end of the line

00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:05,310
just sounded like an angel.

00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:11,510
I felt comfortable.

00:02:11,510 --> 00:02:15,510
I just had the best first impression and I was so scared.

00:02:15,510 --> 00:02:19,510
And so she just talked to me like, it's okay, it's going to be okay.

00:02:19,510 --> 00:02:21,510
No matter what your results are, you're going to be okay.

00:02:21,510 --> 00:02:24,510
So I was able to take care of you.

00:02:24,510 --> 00:02:30,510
So I went in and long story short, I ended up being diagnosed with cancer

00:02:30,510 --> 00:02:33,510
or so my intuition served to me correct.

00:02:33,510 --> 00:02:37,510
But I knew now that based on this consultation with Dr. Connors,

00:02:37,510 --> 00:02:39,510
that I was in the right place.

00:02:39,510 --> 00:02:44,510
I did not need to worry anymore, no matter what the outcome was.

00:02:44,510 --> 00:02:48,510
I was going to be helped or I was going to die trying.

00:02:48,510 --> 00:02:52,510
But without, I was being helped.

00:02:52,510 --> 00:02:58,510
I ended up in the hands of people that served my beliefs.

00:02:58,510 --> 00:03:06,510
And I felt God's grace just come upon me like, like no other situation in my life.

00:03:06,510 --> 00:03:09,510
And I felt so good every time I walked into that clinic,

00:03:09,510 --> 00:03:11,510
all of the staff just greeted me.

00:03:11,510 --> 00:03:12,510
They knew me by name.

00:03:12,510 --> 00:03:17,510
And that was really important to me because I never got that going to another doctor.

00:03:17,510 --> 00:03:20,510
There was nobody that ever treated me like I was family,

00:03:20,510 --> 00:03:22,510
like they do at Connors Clinic.

00:03:22,510 --> 00:03:25,510
And so I just felt so good.

00:03:25,510 --> 00:03:28,510
And upon hearing that I had cancer,

00:03:28,510 --> 00:03:33,510
it's not typically something that you can feel peace over almost immediately.

00:03:33,510 --> 00:03:40,510
But for me, it was because I knew that I was going to go into the hands of doctors and staff

00:03:40,510 --> 00:03:46,510
that cared about me and cared about my outcome just as much as I did.

00:03:46,510 --> 00:03:48,510
I wasn't just a number to them.

00:03:48,510 --> 00:03:50,510
I was family.

00:03:50,510 --> 00:03:51,510
I felt like family.

00:03:51,510 --> 00:04:01,140
And so I knew that I was going to be cared for.

00:04:01,140 --> 00:04:12,510
So I feel when just and whether or not it's going to work,

00:04:12,510 --> 00:04:15,510
then it might not end up very well for you.

00:04:15,510 --> 00:04:17,510
But if you believe in it with all of your heart,

00:04:17,510 --> 00:04:21,510
and you have a savior and a clinic that's going to help you through it,

00:04:22,510 --> 00:04:24,510
then it's going to work for you.

00:04:24,510 --> 00:04:27,510
And I felt that way about this clinic.

00:04:27,510 --> 00:04:30,510
So I had a lot of people question, why are you doing?

00:04:30,510 --> 00:04:31,510
Why are you not fighting this?

00:04:31,510 --> 00:04:33,510
Why are you not going to go take the medicine?

00:04:33,510 --> 00:04:35,510
And to me, like this is my medicine.

00:04:35,510 --> 00:04:37,510
This is my hope.

00:04:37,510 --> 00:04:39,510
The mental game, the physical game,

00:04:39,510 --> 00:04:43,510
everything about it all together for me is exactly what I believed in

00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:45,510
in receiving natural treatments.

00:04:45,510 --> 00:04:48,510
And so that's exactly the way that I decided to go about it.

00:04:48,510 --> 00:04:50,510
And it did work for me.

00:04:50,510 --> 00:04:55,510
So I'm very grateful and I'm feeling fantastic today.

00:04:55,510 --> 00:05:03,510
And I would like to say that I was very much like this natural organic mom,

00:05:03,510 --> 00:05:05,510
like wellness advocate.

00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:07,510
And so when I was first diagnosed,

00:05:07,510 --> 00:05:11,510
I was really shameful and prideful in myself, like,

00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:14,510
I don't want to tell anybody about this because everybody's going to think

00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:18,510
that all this natural stuff isn't going to work

00:05:18,510 --> 00:05:21,510
and I was looking at this person that advocates for it,

00:05:21,510 --> 00:05:23,510
and she ended up getting cancer.

00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:24,510
What?

00:05:24,510 --> 00:05:27,510
So I was really hushed hushed about it at first until,

00:05:27,510 --> 00:05:29,510
you know, I live in the small town.

00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:31,510
And people started to find out.

00:05:31,510 --> 00:05:33,510
And so I had to kind of come clean.

00:05:33,510 --> 00:05:35,510
And so I started telling people,

00:05:35,510 --> 00:05:37,510
and my husband and I just went on a Facebook live.

00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:39,510
And I said, this is what's going on with me.

00:05:39,510 --> 00:05:41,510
And I received so much support.

00:05:41,510 --> 00:05:42,510
It was just amazing.

00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:44,510
But through that,

00:05:44,510 --> 00:05:47,510
I decided that people really wanted to hear my story.

00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:50,510
And they were really interested in finding out what am I doing?

00:05:50,510 --> 00:05:52,510
And how is this working for me?

00:05:52,510 --> 00:05:54,510
So I decided to start this personal blog.

00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:58,510
And I did that to help everybody understand that there's another way that we can,

00:05:58,510 --> 00:05:59,510
we can go at cancer.

00:05:59,510 --> 00:06:02,510
And a lot of people have come to me and said,

00:06:02,510 --> 00:06:05,820
hey, I heard about your,

00:06:05,820 --> 00:06:13,000
you have to talk to them.

00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:19,000
So not only will I continue to refer people to this clinic because they literally saved me.

00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:22,000
But I will always tell my story.

00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:25,000
I will always talk about how wonderful the staff is.

00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:31,000
And the people that I have referred there and that have become patients there say the same things as me.

00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,000
They're just angels.

00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,000
We love them.

00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:36,000
So that's my story.

00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:43,000
I hope that I can just tell the world about how it worked for me and how it can work for them.

00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:47,000
If you just believe in it and know that your body is stronger than cancer,

00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,000
your body doesn't want it.

00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:55,000
And just believe, just believe in your treatment and believe that your body can do this.

00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:58,000
And Connor's clinic is there to help you every step of the way.

